# `source/` holds raw FBX authoring assets — the Scary Zombie Pack
# from Mixamo. Tracked alongside the rig for now (small pack, easy
# regeneration if needed).

# Larva-rig .ozz files ARE committed (~10 MB total) so CI and
# contributors without FBX2glTF installed can build and run.
# Locally, the CMake bake regenerates them from FBX when present.
# Negate the repo-root *.ozz rule for everything in this directory.
!*.ozz

# Old-rig backups + workflow markers from the MB-Lab humanoid swap
# (2026-06-18). Disk-only, never committed -- kept locally in case
# we ever want to A/B compare against the pre-MB-Lab versions.
*.PRE_MBLAB_REDOWNLOAD
*.PRE_MBLAB_BACKUP
*.NOT_YET_REDOWNLOADED
*.NOT_A_CLIP
*.audit.json
